Change Log.
==================================================================================================================
v.1.0.1. 2026-06-01. No change to API.
Corrected active set identification in UEEResults.
The previous implementation (v1.0.0) used a fixed absolute tolerance:
    np.isclose(abs_resid, E, atol=1e-6)
This is not scale-invariant and may misidentify binding constraints.
Updated to:
      tol = 1e-6 * max(1.0, abs(E))
      abs(abs_resid - E) <= tol
This ensures numerically stable and theoretically consistent
identification of the active set.
Notes:
- No changes to API;
- No changes to estimator;
- Diagnostics may differ slightly across datasets.
==================================================================================================================
